{"id":"hashabiah","name":"Hashabiah","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:hashabiah"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Hashabiah","text":"Regarded by Jehovah. (1.) Merarite Levite (1 Chr. 6:45; 9:14). (2.) A son of Jeduthun (25:3, 19). (3.) Son of Kemuel (26:30). (4.) One of the chief Levites (2 Chr. 35:9). (5.) A Levite (Neh. 11:22). (6.) One of the chief priests in the time of Ezra (Ezra 8:24). (7.) A chief of the Levites (Neh. 12:24). (8.) Ezra 8:19. (9.) Neh. 3:17."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2811","lemma":"חֲשַׁבְיָה","xlit":"Chăshabyâh","gloss":"Chashabjah, the name of nine Israelites","kjv":"Hashabiah","count":15,"share":1},{"strong":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִיִּי","xlit":"Lêvîyîy","gloss":"a Levite or descendant of Levi","kjv":"Leviite","count":7,"share":0.47},{"strong":"H8098","lemma":"שְׁמַעְיָה","xlit":"Shᵉmaʻyâh","gloss":"Shemajah, the name of twenty-five Israelites","kjv":"Shemaiah","count":3,"share":0.2},{"strong":"H2815","lemma":"חַשּׁוּב","xlit":"Chashshûwb","gloss":"Chashshub, the name of two or three Israelites","kjv":"Hashub, Hasshub","count":2,"share":0.13},{"strong":"H4316","lemma":"מִיכָא","xlit":"Mîykâʼ","gloss":"Mica, the name of two Israelites","kjv":"Micha","count":2,"share":0.13},{"strong":"H5840","lemma":"עַזְרִיקָם","xlit":"ʻAzrîyqâm","gloss":"Azrikam, the name of four Israelites","kjv":"Azrikam","count":2,"share":0.13}],"verses":["1Chr.6.45","1Chr.9.14","1Chr.25.3","1Chr.25.19","1Chr.26.30","1Chr.27.17","2Chr.35.9","Ezra.8.19","Ezra.8.24","Neh.3.17","Neh.10.11","Neh.11.15","Neh.11.22","Neh.12.21","Neh.12.24"],"related":[{"id":"shemaiah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.047,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"jesaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H2811","why":"both lead with חֲשַׁבְיָה (H2811)"},{"id":"micha","type":"lexical","strong":"H2811","why":"both lead with חֲשַׁבְיָה (H2811)"},{"id":"bunni","type":"lexical","strong":"H3881","why":"both lead with לֵוִיִּי (H3881)"},{"id":"jeshua","typ